<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Monday 95,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Monday 95,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Monday's est receipts 95,000, Wk ago 94,000, and Yr ago 91,000 head at interior Iowa and southern Minnesota. Estimates include generally about 65 percent carcass base hogs. Barrows and gilts traded steady to $0.50 lower compared with mid-session Friday. Trade was slow to moderate for light to moderate demand and offerings. Top $57.00 per cwt.</p>
